# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; never commit real keys.
# Stadia Maps API key for Stamen Toner tiles (free tier: stadiamaps.com).
# Restrict the key to your domains in the Stadia dashboard, e.g.
# peatoe.github.io. localhost works keyless, so this is only needed for prod.
STADIA_API_KEY=
